From: sbe1v1k 25.12-6.12 port <noreply@sbe1v1k-build>
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: ipq95xx: load the SBE1V1K kernel at 0x42200000

Device/Default in target/linux/qualcommbe/image/Makefile sets
KERNEL_LOADADDR := 0x41000000, and Build/fit-its copies it into the
load/entry properties of the FIT kernel node.  The v21 image therefore
asked the bootloader for 0x41000000, which the vendor memory map keeps
out of limits for a kernel: the 24.10 board DTS carries this board's
vendor reservation as nss@40000000, 32 MiB at 0x40000000..0x42000000.

Known-good values for this board are 0x42200000 (the official OpenWrt
image for askey,sbe1v1k, and what the upstream SBE1V1K flash guide
prescribes; its pitfall list notes that 0x41000000 reboots) and
0x42000000 (the 24.10-6.6 project image, whose DTS comment records the
same reservation - it sits exactly on the boundary, which is why the
official value is preferred here).  Set it per device so the other
ipq95xx boards keep Device/Default.

Observed on v21: fan at full speed and the system never comes up (the
eMMC boot path stops before userspace).  There is no serial log yet to
pin the exact stop point, hence the status line below.

Status: static only, NOT TESTED on hardware.
---
diff -ruN a/target/linux/qualcommbe/image/ipq95xx.mk b/target/linux/qualcommbe/image/ipq95xx.mk
--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/image/ipq95xx.mk
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/image/ipq95xx.mk
@@ -52,6 +52,13 @@
 	DEVICE_DTS_CONFIG := config@rdp433
 	SOC := ipq9574
 	KERNEL_INSTALL := 1
+	# Device/Default ships 0x41000000, which is inside the 32 MiB NSS
+	# reservation (nss@40000000) of the vendor memory map and makes the
+	# eMMC boot fail (boot loop, no console).  0x42200000 is the address
+	# the official OpenWrt image for askey,sbe1v1k uses and the one the
+	# upstream flash guide prescribes for this board; 0x42000000 also
+	# works on 24.10 but sits exactly on the reservation boundary.
+	KERNEL_LOADADDR := 0x42200000
 	KERNEL_SIZE := 6096k
 	IMAGE_SIZE := 25344k
 	DEVICE_PACKAGES := kmod-leds-pwm kmod-hwmon-pwmfan \
@@ -95,6 +102,7 @@
 	DEVICE_DTS_CONFIG := config@rdp433
 	SOC := ipq9574
 	KERNEL_INSTALL := 1
+	KERNEL_LOADADDR := 0x42200000
 	KERNEL_SIZE := 6096k
 	IMAGE_SIZE := 25344k
 	DEVICE_PACKAGES := kmod-leds-pwm kmod-hwmon-pwmfan kmod-qcom-ppe
